  "document": {
    "fileName": "stagec_eval_doc.md",
    "title": "DocPilot Stage C Eval Document",
    "content": "# DocPilot Stage C Eval Document\n\nDocPilot provides chunk upload and resumable upload for large files.\nDefault parse flow: upload -> create document -> create parse task.\nParsing is asynchronous and can be retried when needed.\n\nQA path: lightweight retrieval-enhanced QA, not vector RAG.\nAnswers may include citations with chunk index and char range.\n\nSSE contract: events are meta/chunk/done/error in order.\nFrontend fallback policy: if SSE stream breaks, frontend must fall back to non-stream QA automatically.\nNon-goal: frontend should not refresh full page as fallback.\n\nDefault AI mode is mock.\nReal mode prerequisites: set AI_REAL_BASE_URL, AI_REAL_API_KEY, AI_REAL_MODEL, and use an OpenAI-compatible provider.\n\nKnown boundary: PDF parsing is placeholder today; txt/md are the main supported parsing paths.\nEngineering highlights: RocketMQ + Outbox for async parse pipeline, Redisson for lock/idempotency, Redis for cache and rate limiting.\n\nEvaluation policy: stream and non-stream answers should be semantically consistent.\nDeprecated note (obsolete, do not follow): \"default ai mode is real\".\n"
  },
